<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/advisoryCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "FDA advisory committee code for the device type." .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/advisoryCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "advisory committee" .
