<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/affectsComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Affects component. Declared in the schema but not populated in the current release." .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/affectsComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "affects component" .
