<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSClassification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a manufacturer or an FDA product classification record to its NAICS industry. 10,432 of the 53,499 manufacturers carry between one and nine industries, and 1,589 classification records carry one. The links sit on the classification-record nodes (IRIs ending productcode/<code>) and on the 132 of them that are also typed FDA Product Code. md:hasProductCode mostly leads to the separate product-code/<code> nodes, which have no NAICS link (no 510(k) record reaches one that way), so join submissions to a NAICS industry on the md:productCode literal. The assignments are inferred by the knowledge graph's crosswalk and are not supplied by FDA." .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has NAICS classification" .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSMapping> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an FDA product classification record to the crosswalk assertion that records how its NAICS industry was assigned. The links sit on the classification-record nodes (IRIs ending productcode/<code>) and on the 132 of them that are also typed FDA Product Code. md:hasProductCode mostly leads to the separate product-code/<code> nodes, which have no NAICS link (no 510(k) record reaches one that way), so join submissions to a NAICS industry on the md:productCode literal." .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasNAICSMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has NAICS mapping" .
<http://medicaldevice.com/ontology/hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
